<title>USA: Community Central edges higher after IPO.</title>
<headline>Community Central edges higher after IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Community Central Bankcorp edged higher, up 1/4 to 10-1/4, after the company's initial public offering on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company offered 1.0 million shares at $10 each.</p>
<p>It originally planned to offer 800,000 shares.</p>
<p>The deal was lead-managed by Roney &amp; Co.</p>
